Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‑mean on pool1 to see if trimming extreme errors improves over the current median winner.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool1","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a larger pool with weighted averaging improves over trimmed_mean pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

